10:11:05 settled
🔴 postgres in shop (prod-eu-1) keeps running out of memory because its memory limit is too low for normal use. It was killed within 10 seconds of starting. Services api and postgres can't serve traffic. Users can't reach shop.example.com. It runs a single replica. Fix: raise the memory limit of container app in deployment/postgres above 512Mi.
Related alerts: 2 services without endpoints
To read the output of the last crash, run kubectl logs deploy/postgres -c app -n shop --previous
